title: A multi-contained link is probably a bad idea.
pid: 6b4cca97-da22-4358-8990-589029860181
body: |2-
  If each link has a distinct id,
  then each link's relationship to its ancestry
  can be separately elaborated on with text and content atoms.

  A potential exception is two copies of a link
  contains-descended from the same unique container root.
